Package: MetaTrajectory
Type: Package
Title: Optimal Transport-Based Metabolic Trajectory Analysis for Single-Cell Data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("MetaTrajectory", "Team",
           email = "metatrajectory@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
    A mathematically rigorous framework for analyzing metabolic state transitions
    in single-cell RNA-seq data using optimal transport theory. The package
    provides network-constrained metabolic state space construction, optimal
    transport-based trajectory inference, fate probability estimation, and
    driver gene identification. Designed to integrate with Seurat workflows.
